  <p id="c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001:m0000" ref="0zd_9uz_t7m_ABA">臧質</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001:m0003" ref="0zd_9uz_t7m_ABA">含文</persName>，東莞莒人。父<persName id="c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001:m0012" ref="0zd_9uz_t7m_AB">熹</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001:m0014" ref="0zd_9uz_t7m_AB">義和</persName>，武敬皇后弟也。與兄<persName id="c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001:m0026" ref="fx3_a98_dj5">燾</persName>並好經籍。</p>
